## Title: CreatureAffixes
## Version: 0.3.3
## Notes: The server writes creature prefixes and affixes into the creature name, so target frames and all nameplates show them. This add-on keeps the marker and effect aura buttons out of the aura bar. Needs the server's mod-creature-affixes; the hidden size layer is intentionally not shown.
